{"4504970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AetherCycle", "steam_appid": 4504970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AetherCycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vast world shaped by the Cycle.<br>Explore ancient lands, battle powerful enemies, and forge your path through fast-paced combat, character progression, and rewarding loot in this first-person action RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World &amp; The Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and living world filled with ancient ruins, hidden paths, dangerous dungeons, and forgotten places. From quiet villages to deep underground domains, every location holds secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cycle reshapes the world over time — shifting the balance of danger and reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced first-person combat against relentless enemies, elite foes, and powerful bosses. Combine weapons, abilities, and timing to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build matters — but how you fight matters even more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character through leveling, attributes, abilities, and passive perks. Unlock new powers, refine your playstyle, and grow stronger as you face greater challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot &amp; Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, armor, and items with randomized stats, rarity tiers, and unique effects. Find powerful upgrades and rare legendary gear that can completely transform your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends. Explore the world, complete quests, defeat bosses, and progress your character together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AetherCycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vast world shaped by the Cycle.<br>Explore ancient lands, battle powerful enemies, and forge your path through fast-paced combat, character progression, and rewarding loot in this first-person action RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World &amp; The Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and living world filled with ancient ruins, hidden paths, dangerous dungeons, and forgotten places. From quiet villages to deep underground domains, every location holds secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cycle reshapes the world over time — shifting the balance of danger and reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced first-person combat against relentless enemies, elite foes, and powerful bosses. Combine weapons, abilities, and timing to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build matters — but how you fight matters even more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character through leveling, attributes, abilities, and passive perks. Unlock new powers, refine your playstyle, and grow stronger as you face greater challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot &amp; Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, armor, and items with randomized stats, rarity tiers, and unique effects. Find powerful upgrades and rare legendary gear that can completely transform your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends. Explore the world, complete quests, defeat bosses, and progress your character together.</p>", "short_description": "AetherCycle is a first-person action RPG featuring fast-paced combat, character leveling, abilities, and loot-driven gear progression. Explore a vast world, conquer dungeons, and grow stronger solo or in co-op as the Cycle reshapes the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "